      "html": "<div class=\"container-fluid py-5\">\n        <div class=\"container py-5\">\n            <div class=\"row g-5 align-items-start\">\n                <div class=\"col-lg-8\">\n                    <span class=\"text-uppercase text-primary fw-bold d-block mb-2\" style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;\">Author</span>\n                    <h2 class=\"h1 mb-4\">Content Writer &amp; Digital Marketing Professional</h2>\n                    <p class=\"lead-answer\">Shivam Kumar is a content writer and digital marketing professional with an\n                        interest in SEO, technology, and digital growth. He focuses on creating clear, useful, and\n                        research-driven content that helps readers understand complex topics in a simple way.</p>\n                    <p>On The Omega Group's blog, Shivam writes the interior design guides, cost breakdowns, and\n                        planning articles published under his byline — researched and written to be genuinely useful\n                        to someone planning a home or office interior project, and reviewed for technical accuracy by\n                        The Omega Group's in-house design team.</p>\n                    <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/shivam-growth-engineer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n                        class=\"btn btn-primary py-3 px-4 mt-2\">\n                        <i class=\"fab fa-linkedin-in me-2\"></i>Connect on LinkedIn\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n                    <div class=\"author-box\" style=\"margin: 0;\">\n                        <div class=\"author-box-logo\" style=\"width: 72px; height: 72px; font-size: 1.8rem;\">S</div>\n                        <div>\n                            <h3>Shivam Kumar</h3>\n                            <p class=\"mb-0\">Author at The Omega Group</p>\n                            <div class=\"author-box-links\">\n                               